Package: cockpit-dockerstacks
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: cockpit-bridge
Replaces: cockpit-docker (<< 0.1.1)
Breaks: cockpit-docker (<< 0.1.1)
Provides: cockpit-docker
Recommends: docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose
Maintainer: Alex Vandeputte <avandeputte@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/avandeputte/cockpit-dockerstacks
Description: Docker Compose stack manager for Cockpit
 Manage Docker Compose stacks from the Cockpit web console: create and edit
 compose.yaml and .env files, deploy, start, stop, restart, update and delete
 stacks, follow logs, open a shell inside containers, convert "docker run"
 commands, and manage stacks on other hosts.
 .
 A port of Dockge to Cockpit.
